                "text_NdncVd": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Our leather is a byproduct of the meat industry — no animal is raised for it — and it comes from tanneries in Italy, France and Germany that we have visited ourselves. Exotic hides follow a separate, documented chain: sourced and traded under CITES, processed in Italy, papers available on request.</p><p>We would rather say exactly where a hide came from than call it sustainable.</p>",
